1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,400
<font color="#FFFFFF">Prepare yourself!</font>

2
00:00:10,241 --> 00:00:11,271
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why you—!</font>

3
00:00:22,372 --> 00:00:25,002
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you mean by suddenly
pouncing on Kakashi Sensei like that?</font>

4
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:26,602
<font color="#FFFFFF">You wrinkly old hag!</font>

5
00:00:28,303 --> 00:00:31,073
<font color="#FFFFFF">This old hag... is good...</font>

6
00:00:33,173 --> 00:00:35,343
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll never forget what
you did back then!</font>

7
00:00:36,043 --> 00:00:38,804
<font color="#FFFFFF">White Fang of the Leaf,</font>

8
00:00:38,844 --> 00:00:42,904
<font color="#FFFFFF">I shall avenge my son's death
by defeating you today!</font>

9
00:00:43,074 --> 00:00:44,774
<font color="#FFFFFF">Er... no, you see... I'm...</font>

10
00:00:44,804 --> 00:00:46,544
<font color="#FFFFFF">No questions or answers!</font>

11
00:00:50,005 --> 00:00:52,605
<font color="#FFFFFF">Big Sister...
Take a good look at him!</font>

12
00:00:56,246 --> 00:01:00,806
<font color="#FFFFFF">He resembles him closely,
but this one is not the White Fang!</font>

13
00:01:01,106 --> 00:01:02,046
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

14
00:01:03,906 --> 00:01:04,806
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh... hello...</font>

15
00:01:05,447 --> 00:01:09,477
<font color="#FFFFFF">Moreover, the White Fang
of the Leaf died long ago.</font>

16
00:01:10,807 --> 00:01:12,447
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember?</font>

17
00:01:12,477 --> 00:01:14,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">When you got word of it,
you cried tears of regret,</font>

18
00:01:14,708 --> 00:01:17,778
<font color="#FFFFFF">since you could not avenge
your son.</font>

19
00:01:19,408 --> 00:01:20,878
<font color="#FFFFFF">Isn't that so, Sis?</font>

20
00:01:23,448 --> 00:01:26,509
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gotcha, I was only pretending
to have gone senile.</font>

21
00:01:39,810 --> 00:01:40,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro!</font>

22
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:42,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let me have a look.</font>

23
00:01:42,681 --> 00:01:43,681
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please do.</font>

24
00:01:43,751 --> 00:01:46,681
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei and the rest of you,
please stand back a bit.</font>

25
00:01:46,981 --> 00:01:48,251
<font color="#FFFFFF">Got it.</font>

26
00:02:20,915 --> 00:02:23,015
<font color="#FFFFFF">H-Hey! You're...?</font>

27
00:02:24,055 --> 00:02:25,515
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm a Leaf Medical Ninja.</font>

28
00:03:57,025 --> 00:04:01,796
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Medical Ninja's Student</font>

29
00:04:15,967 --> 00:04:18,627
<font color="#FFFFFF">They seem to have used
a heavy metal-based toxin.</font>

30
00:04:19,998 --> 00:04:22,768
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the type that acts upon
the muscles to destroy the cells.</font>

31
00:04:24,928 --> 00:04:26,668
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just from that brief examination...</font>

32
00:04:26,928 --> 00:04:27,998
<font color="#FFFFFF">You could tell that much...</font>

33
00:04:28,928 --> 00:04:29,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">His medical record please.</font>

34
00:04:29,769 --> 00:04:31,469
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah, here it is.</font>

35
00:04:31,999 --> 00:04:34,129
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is the list
of toxic ingredients.</font>

36
00:04:34,569 --> 00:04:36,429
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are blank spaces here
and there, but...</font>

37
00:04:37,229 --> 00:04:38,870
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can predict the general outcome.</font>

38
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:42,670
<font color="#FFFFFF">The cardiac muscle
will be destroyed,</font>

39
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:45,300
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the heart could stop beating
at any time, so...</font>

40
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:49,371
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's difficult to say whether
we can concoct an antidote in time...</font>

41
00:04:49,931 --> 00:04:52,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't mean that!
Isn't there anything we can do?</font>

42
00:04:55,901 --> 00:04:58,072
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please assemble the items
I request immediately.</font>

43
00:04:58,532 --> 00:04:59,302
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger!</font>

44
00:04:59,502 --> 00:05:03,132
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's quite a crude treatment, but
it's the only option we have left.</font>

45
00:05:49,377 --> 00:05:51,137
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hold him down firmly,</font>

46
00:05:51,277 --> 00:05:53,578
<font color="#FFFFFF">as this will be
a very delicate operation.</font>

47
00:05:53,878 --> 00:05:55,538
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Right.
- Understood.</font>

48
00:06:10,439 --> 00:06:11,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here... goes...</font>

49
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,040
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hold him down firmly!</font>

50
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,610
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes!
- Yes!</font>

51
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:22,341
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll cause the Chakra
to flow into his body...</font>

52
00:06:30,442 --> 00:06:32,842
<font color="#FFFFFF">It will cause the toxin to
surface from the cells.</font>

53
00:06:34,182 --> 00:06:36,442
<font color="#FFFFFF">It will then be absorbed
by this liquid...</font>

54
00:06:38,242 --> 00:06:39,343
<font color="#FFFFFF">and extracted!</font>

55
00:06:51,714 --> 00:06:54,014
<font color="#FFFFFF">So that's the toxin...</font>

56
00:06:59,685 --> 00:07:00,385
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes!</font>

57
00:07:03,745 --> 00:07:04,615
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next!</font>

58
00:07:04,845 --> 00:07:05,685
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yes!
- Yes!</font>

59
00:07:24,187 --> 00:07:26,248
<font color="#FFFFFF">Say... Kakashi Sensei...</font>

60
00:07:26,318 --> 00:07:27,248
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

61
00:07:27,418 --> 00:07:29,548
<font color="#FFFFFF">What sort of person was
that White Fang of the Leaf</font>

62
00:07:29,588 --> 00:07:32,218
<font color="#FFFFFF">that this old lady here
was talking about?</font>

63
00:07:33,788 --> 00:07:35,749
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, that's hard to say...</font>

64
00:07:36,449 --> 00:07:37,519
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hmm, let's see...</font>

65
00:07:38,589 --> 00:07:40,819
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, in a word...</font>

66
00:07:42,149 --> 00:07:43,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">He was my father.</font>

67
00:07:49,350 --> 00:07:50,850
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, you there...</font>

68
00:07:51,450 --> 00:07:53,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you the son
of the White Fang?</font>

69
00:07:53,721 --> 00:07:54,591
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes...</font>

70
00:07:56,491 --> 00:07:57,751
<font color="#FFFFFF">But of course...</font>

71
00:07:58,251 --> 00:08:00,191
<font color="#FFFFFF">So that's why you look
so much like him...</font>

72
00:08:43,496 --> 00:08:45,056
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Next!
- Yes!</font>

73
00:08:59,498 --> 00:09:01,158
<font color="#FFFFFF">I directly extracted the toxin.</font>

74
00:09:01,758 --> 00:09:04,298
<font color="#FFFFFF">With this, his life should
no longer be in danger.</font>

75
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:08,759
<font color="#FFFFFF">Way to go, Sakura!</font>

76
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,900
<font color="#FFFFFF">But we still can't rest easy.</font>

77
00:09:22,500 --> 00:09:25,961
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will now concoct an antidote
for the traces of toxin</font>

78
00:09:26,001 --> 00:09:28,231
<font color="#FFFFFF">that remain in his body.</font>

79
00:09:28,431 --> 00:09:29,661
<font color="#FFFFFF">Got it.</font>

80
00:09:29,701 --> 00:09:32,501
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you need anything,
don't hesitate to ask.</font>

81
00:09:32,701 --> 00:09:35,362
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well then, first, I need a list
of the medicinal herbs</font>

82
00:09:35,402 --> 00:09:37,062
<font color="#FFFFFF">that can be found in this village,
or something like that...</font>

83
00:09:37,462 --> 00:09:38,562
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll bring it.</font>

84
00:09:38,702 --> 00:09:40,532
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please replace all of
his bandages.</font>

85
00:09:40,562 --> 00:09:41,402
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes.</font>

86
00:09:42,402 --> 00:09:44,032
<font color="#FFFFFF">And then prepare an IV drip.</font>

87
00:09:44,102 --> 00:09:44,933
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes.</font>

88
00:09:45,463 --> 00:09:49,063
<font color="#FFFFFF">Also, please set aside a small amount
of the extracted toxin.</font>

89
00:09:49,163 --> 00:09:50,833
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will need it later.</font>

90
00:09:52,803 --> 00:09:55,864
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura... You're so cool.</font>

91
00:10:03,005 --> 00:10:05,835
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're just like
the Slug Girl.</font>

92
00:10:06,665 --> 00:10:10,005
<font color="#FFFFFF">To think that a girl just
like you would come here...</font>

93
00:10:12,466 --> 00:10:15,736
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, Lady Tsunade is my master.</font>

94
00:10:16,206 --> 00:10:19,106
<font color="#FFFFFF">And besides, I was told by
my master to come here.</font>

95
00:10:22,807 --> 00:10:24,167
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here is the list of medicinal herbs.</font>

96
00:10:24,467 --> 00:10:25,737
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you.</font>

97
00:10:30,007 --> 00:10:34,938
<font color="#FFFFFF">Say Sis... Time is flowing slowly,
but it's flowing.</font>

98
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:53,410
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey! Takamaru has returned!</font>

99
00:10:55,510 --> 00:10:57,970
<font color="#FFFFFF">Master Baki, a reply
has come from Leaf Village.</font>

100
00:10:58,671 --> 00:10:59,611
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you for your troubles.</font>

101
00:11:03,411 --> 00:11:04,441
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's from the Hokage.</font>

102
00:11:07,371 --> 00:11:09,372
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's Granny Tsunade saying?</font>

103
00:11:11,372 --> 00:11:14,612
<font color="#FFFFFF">It says that Guy's squad has been
sent here as a reinforcement unit.</font>

104
00:11:19,473 --> 00:11:21,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bushy Brow Sensei's squad...?</font>

105
00:11:31,114 --> 00:11:34,044
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll bet everyone has gotten stronger.</font>

106
00:11:34,444 --> 00:11:36,915
<font color="#FFFFFF">They even said that Neji
has become a Jonin.</font>

107
00:11:38,845 --> 00:11:39,915
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

108
00:11:39,945 --> 00:11:42,475
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now's no time for us to just
be hanging around!</font>

109
00:11:42,775 --> 00:11:44,976
<font color="#FFFFFF">We should go after the Akatsuki...
right now!</font>

110
00:11:45,016 --> 00:11:46,476
<font color="#FFFFFF">Going after him is
fine and well...</font>

111
00:11:46,516 --> 00:11:49,046
<font color="#FFFFFF">But do you know where
those guys have gone to?</font>

112
00:11:53,146 --> 00:11:56,017
<font color="#FFFFFF">Um, excuse me for inquiring,</font>

113
00:11:56,047 --> 00:11:59,047
<font color="#FFFFFF">but what is the follow-up
to the Akatsuki pursuit?</font>

114
00:12:01,847 --> 00:12:06,548
<font color="#FFFFFF">First, Kankuro set off by himself
and ended up like that.</font>

115
00:12:09,018 --> 00:12:13,149
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next, a tracking unit was sent out,
but they've yet to contact us.</font>

116
00:12:14,179 --> 00:12:17,179
<font color="#FFFFFF">Judging from the situation,
it's likely that...</font>

117
00:12:18,179 --> 00:12:21,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">One of the other village chiefs
has gone missing.</font>

118
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:25,250
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like to think that
he could be taken out so easily, but...</font>

119
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:29,950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then, you mean to say
you've completely lost sight of him?</font>

120
00:12:30,350 --> 00:12:32,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, that is so.</font>

121
00:12:33,051 --> 00:12:34,381
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Baki!</font>

122
00:12:34,621 --> 00:12:36,421
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro has awoken!</font>

123
00:12:43,082 --> 00:12:45,082
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro, are you all right?</font>

124
00:12:46,782 --> 00:12:50,583
<font color="#FFFFFF">What, you're back already, Temari...?</font>

125
00:12:51,253 --> 00:12:52,923
<font color="#FFFFFF">I heard the village was in crisis.</font>

126
00:12:53,623 --> 00:12:56,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry... for making you worry.</font>

127
00:12:56,653 --> 00:12:58,884
<font color="#FFFFFF">You fool, don't talk
such nonsense!</font>

128
00:12:59,524 --> 00:13:02,154
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please lead me to the place
where Kankuro did battle.</font>

129
00:13:03,924 --> 00:13:06,624
<font color="#FFFFFF">I may not look it,
but I'm a pro at tracking...</font>

130
00:13:07,054 --> 00:13:09,185
<font color="#FFFFFF">If just the slightest trace
of their scent remains...</font>

131
00:13:09,285 --> 00:13:10,685
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's no need of that.</font>

132
00:13:15,925 --> 00:13:20,256
<font color="#FFFFFF">My puppets... have all been recovered,
haven't they?</font>

133
00:13:34,327 --> 00:13:36,258
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never imagined I'd find
this assortment</font>

134
00:13:36,288 --> 00:13:39,558
<font color="#FFFFFF">of medicinal herbs here
in the Hidden Sand.</font>

135
00:13:40,888 --> 00:13:44,758
<font color="#FFFFFF">Still, the soil is not well suited
to growing medicinal herbs...</font>

136
00:13:45,359 --> 00:13:47,459
<font color="#FFFFFF">In particular, we only have
a small amount of "Scurvy Grass."</font>

137
00:13:47,529 --> 00:13:50,029
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, this much is plenty.</font>

138
00:13:50,759 --> 00:13:52,689
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can make at least three antidotes.</font>

139
00:13:55,130 --> 00:13:56,560
<font color="#FFFFFF">The enemy force was two
in number.</font>

140
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:59,560
<font color="#FFFFFF">One of them led Gaara away...</font>

141
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,530
<font color="#FFFFFF">All you have to do it follow
Gaara's scent.</font>

142
00:14:03,590 --> 00:14:07,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even if they split up into two,
one of them...</font>

143
00:14:08,731 --> 00:14:10,791
<font color="#FFFFFF">His smell is on that one...</font>

144
00:14:17,332 --> 00:14:18,862
<font color="#FFFFFF">In Crow's hand...</font>

145
00:14:19,092 --> 00:14:21,432
<font color="#FFFFFF">I left him holding a scrap
of his clothes...</font>

146
00:14:25,633 --> 00:14:27,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even if you fall,
you won't fall without a fight...</font>

147
00:14:28,793 --> 00:14:30,733
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just what I'd expect from
a Sand Ninja.</font>

148
00:14:34,094 --> 00:14:35,834
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro! Are you all right?</font>

149
00:14:36,794 --> 00:14:38,394
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-Yeah...</font>

150
00:14:44,995 --> 00:14:48,065
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah, he came all the way
from Hidden Leaf Village for us.</font>

151
00:14:52,536 --> 00:14:55,436
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto... Uzumaki... is it?</font>

152
00:14:57,036 --> 00:14:57,996
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey...</font>

153
00:15:00,437 --> 00:15:01,397
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see...</font>

154
00:15:02,597 --> 00:15:03,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

155
00:15:08,938 --> 00:15:11,798
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eight Ninja Dogs,
at your service!</font>

156
00:15:12,368 --> 00:15:13,498
<font color="#FFFFFF">Pakkun!</font>

157
00:15:13,698 --> 00:15:16,868
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey! Is that you, Naruto?
Long time no see.</font>

158
00:15:16,938 --> 00:15:19,599
<font color="#FFFFFF">Pakkun, you haven't changed a bit,
have you?</font>

159
00:15:19,869 --> 00:15:20,969
<font color="#FFFFFF">You haven't either.</font>

160
00:15:20,999 --> 00:15:25,099
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eh? I've grown quite a bit taller.</font>

161
00:15:25,299 --> 00:15:28,400
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, yes, but enough
of this chatter.</font>

162
00:15:28,640 --> 00:15:30,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">I need you to get to work
right away!</font>

163
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:37,541
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want you to determine
which way he headed.</font>

164
00:15:38,101 --> 00:15:38,841
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, go!</font>

165
00:15:39,801 --> 00:15:42,541
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll contact you right away
when we find something.</font>

166
00:15:45,501 --> 00:15:47,002
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're counting on you.</font>

167
00:15:51,372 --> 00:15:52,442
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right!</font>

168
00:15:53,302 --> 00:15:55,573
<font color="#FFFFFF">When Pakkun and the others
get back,</font>

169
00:15:55,603 --> 00:15:56,803
<font color="#FFFFFF">we're heading out, I tell you!</font>

170
00:15:56,843 --> 00:15:57,973
<font color="#FFFFFF">We've got to make preparations
right away...</font>

171
00:15:58,003 --> 00:15:59,873
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, wait a minute!</font>

172
00:16:02,703 --> 00:16:04,174
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro...!</font>

173
00:16:05,504 --> 00:16:08,444
<font color="#FFFFFF">Granny Chiyo?
Grandpa Ebizo, too?</font>

174
00:16:08,774 --> 00:16:12,404
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want to hear it one more time,
directly from your mouth...</font>

175
00:16:13,104 --> 00:16:16,405
<font color="#FFFFFF">There is no mistake that one
of the two enemies was Sasori.</font>

176
00:16:16,445 --> 00:16:18,245
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is that correct?</font>

177
00:16:21,705 --> 00:16:24,346
<font color="#FFFFFF">What about it, Kankuro?</font>

178
00:16:25,276 --> 00:16:28,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah... It was Sasori
of the Red Sand.</font>

179
00:16:28,376 --> 00:16:30,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">He said so himself.</font>

180
00:16:35,507 --> 00:16:37,447
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasori of the Red Sand,
you say?</font>

181
00:16:38,607 --> 00:16:41,678
<font color="#FFFFFF">We might be able to find out more
about Akatsuki.</font>

182
00:16:43,178 --> 00:16:44,378
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please...</font>

183
00:17:17,511 --> 00:17:18,512
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's ready...</font>

184
00:17:28,613 --> 00:17:30,183
<font color="#FFFFFF">Be sure to drink it all down...</font>

185
00:17:40,214 --> 00:17:42,314
<font color="#FFFFFF">You should be all right now, I think.</font>

186
00:17:42,914 --> 00:17:45,284
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just lie there and rest for
a while without moving</font>

187
00:17:45,314 --> 00:17:46,815
<font color="#FFFFFF">until the numbness goes away.</font>

188
00:17:47,555 --> 00:17:50,315
<font color="#FFFFFF">You should all get
a good night's rest as well.</font>

189
00:17:50,355 --> 00:17:51,985
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've prepared a room for you to use.</font>

190
00:17:52,115 --> 00:17:54,485
<font color="#FFFFFF">But we've got to find Gaara quickly...</font>

191
00:17:54,515 --> 00:17:56,556
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll take advantage of
your kindness, if I may.</font>

192
00:17:58,316 --> 00:18:00,786
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're going on
a harsh march from tomorrow.</font>

193
00:18:05,287 --> 00:18:06,657
<font color="#FFFFFF">I understand...</font>

194
00:18:19,988 --> 00:18:23,759
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just have to work hard and
carve out a future for myself.</font>

195
00:18:24,419 --> 00:18:27,159
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I must not run away
from my path of solitude.</font>

196
00:18:28,759 --> 00:18:31,219
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I do that, someday...</font>

197
00:18:32,560 --> 00:18:33,960
<font color="#FFFFFF">Someday... I can be like him...</font>

198
00:18:38,020 --> 00:18:40,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't order me around!</font>

199
00:18:41,761 --> 00:18:43,161
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's enough outta you!</font>

200
00:18:44,091 --> 00:18:47,161
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have never thought
of you all as my brothers.</font>

201
00:18:47,891 --> 00:18:51,022
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you get in my way,
I'll kill you.</font>

202
00:18:54,822 --> 00:19:00,993
<font color="#FFFFFF">But now there's something
I understand about the bonds</font>

203
00:19:01,023 --> 00:19:04,293
<font color="#FFFFFF">he went so far to tell me about.</font>

204
00:19:06,063 --> 00:19:09,594
<font color="#FFFFFF">I understand that pain,
sadness... and happiness...</font>

205
00:19:10,824 --> 00:19:14,024
<font color="#FFFFFF">can be shared with others.</font>

206
00:19:15,764 --> 00:19:17,694
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto Uzumaki...</font>

207
00:19:18,164 --> 00:19:23,265
<font color="#FFFFFF">I learned that through fighting
and getting to know him.</font>

208
00:19:26,565 --> 00:19:29,696
<font color="#FFFFFF">He knew of the same pain
as me.</font>

209
00:19:30,466 --> 00:19:35,166
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he taught me that I could
change the path of my life.</font>

210
00:19:41,767 --> 00:19:43,467
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto Uzumaki...</font>

211
00:19:43,897 --> 00:19:44,867
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mm?</font>

212
00:19:46,427 --> 00:19:49,098
<font color="#FFFFFF">Take care of my little brother...</font>

213
00:19:52,698 --> 00:19:54,268
<font color="#FFFFFF">Heh, you can leave it to me.</font>

214
00:19:55,929 --> 00:19:58,499
<font color="#FFFFFF">After all, I am eventually going
to become the Hokage!</font>

215
00:19:59,099 --> 00:20:02,169
<font color="#FFFFFF">So I'll do the Kazekage
a favor early on!</font>

216
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:39,980
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aim to remain in active duty
your entire life!</font>

217
00:21:40,010 --> 00:21:41,580
<font color="#FFFFFF">Today, the High Achievers Club</font>

218
00:21:41,610 --> 00:21:43,210
<font color="#FFFFFF">is pleased to introduce Granny Chiyo
of the Hidden Sand.</font>

219
00:21:43,910 --> 00:21:45,240
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, to get right to the point,
what are your hobbies?</font>

220
00:21:45,280 --> 00:21:47,181
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Fishing.
- What a simple answer.</font>

221
00:21:47,211 --> 00:21:48,441
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well then,
what is your special forte?</font>

222
00:21:48,481 --> 00:21:50,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Playing dead.
- Your individuality shines!</font>

223
00:21:50,581 --> 00:21:52,011
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well next, what are your concerns
at this time?</font>

224
00:21:52,041 --> 00:21:52,841
<font color="#FFFFFF">My grandchild.</font>

225
00:21:53,211 --> 00:21:54,781
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, are you watching? Sasori?</font>

226
00:21:56,111 --> 00:22:01,012
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll be the one to punish you!
Wash your neck and wait!</font>

227
00:22:02,282 --> 00:22:05,082
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time:
"The Retired Granny's Determination"</font>

